BT /F1 11 Tf 50 780 Td 14 TL (Classic Turkish Menemen Recipe) Tj T* () Tj T* (Ingredients:) Tj T* (- 4 eggs) Tj T* (- 3 ripe tomatoes, diced) Tj T* (- 2 green peppers, chopped) Tj T* (- 1 onion  optional ) Tj T* (- Salt, black pepper, red pepper flakes) Tj T* (- Olive oil) Tj T* () Tj T* (Instructions:) Tj T* (1. Heat olive oil in a pan. Add peppers and saute for 3 minutes.) Tj T* (2. Add diced tomatoes and cook until soft, about 8 minutes.) Tj T* (3. Season with salt and pepper flakes.) Tj T* (4. Crack the eggs into the pan and stir gently.) Tj T* (5. Cook until the eggs are just set. Serve hot with bread.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Enjoy your breakfast!) Tj T* () Tj ET
